{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":610890,"name":"Alpenes Kasap","username":"Alpenes_Kasap","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/alpenes_kasap/{size}/198789_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-08T20:43:24.967Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eWe’re hiring at Beyond Creator, Canada’s first AI-powered marketing agency, founded in Toronto. We produce 200+ pieces of content each month for restaurants and hospitality brands.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe’re looking for someone who enjoys understanding how a creative team works, keeping projects moving, and building practical tools that people actually use.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-610890-the-work-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-610890-the-work-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eThe work\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHelp keep priorities, deadlines and handoffs clear in Notion and Slack.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuild useful AI workflows with n8n, APIs and webhooks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWrite, debug and publish small applications.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTest the workflows, handle failures and document how they work.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBring good visual judgment and an understanding of marketing or creative production.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is an ongoing remote, part-time role, starting at about 15 hours per week, with room to grow as the collaboration develops. Applications are welcome from Canada, Türkiye and elsewhere. Clear English and some overlap with Toronto working hours matter. Turkish is a plus.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-610890-show-us-something-you-built-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-610890-show-us-something-you-built-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eShow us something you built\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA useful personal AI project counts. Please share the problem, what you personally built, a demo and a code sample or published app. We’d also like one example of a project you helped coordinate. A CV is optional.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApply through our form:\u003c/p\u003e\u003caside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://beyondcreator.notion.site/b70000f9cb5141ef94baea3ae0d5d577?pvs=105\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"https://beyondcreator.notion.site/images/favicon.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://beyondcreator.notion.site/b70000f9cb5141ef94baea3ae0d5d577?pvs=105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eNotion\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/359;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/d/6/d6eee640fa56bd13f0027b4d13af1a9c8ff259b3_2_690x359.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"E9E8E9\" width=\"690\" height=\"359\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://beyondcreator.notion.site/b70000f9cb5141ef94baea3ae0d5d577?pvs=105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eNotion | Where teams and agents work together\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n  \u003cp\u003eMade in Notion, the connected workspace where AI agents and teams organize docs, projects and knowledge together.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIf you have already completed this form for the role, there is no need to submit it again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompany: \u003ca href=\"https://beyondcreator.ca\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://beyondcreator.ca\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003csmall\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/information_source.png?v=16\" title=\":information_source:\" class=\